+issueNumber: MDL-89890
+notes:
+  mod_forum:
+    - message: >-
+        The `viewandmanageselect` context of the
+        `mod_forum/forum_subscription_action` template, which contains
+        `url_select` data (as rendered by `core/url_select`), has been
+        deprecated and is only kept for backwards compatibility with template
+        overrides. Use the new `viewandmanageselectmenu` context instead, which
+        contains `select_menu` data to be rendered with
+        `core/tertiary_navigation_selector`.
+      type: deprecated
